# Accounting Journal Entry Line
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Accounting — the individual debit/credit facts a Trial Balance reports over
# Case 9 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: accounting-chart-of-account.menata, accounting-journal-entry.menata
#
# Unlike Case 5's Item Unit Conversion (a pure per-parent lookup table), a Journal
# Entry Line is always authored together with its parent Journal Entry (header +
# lines commit and post as one unit — CAP-F16), but must remain independently
# queryable across every Journal Entry for the Trial Balance report below (CAP-V13).

Journal Entry Line

Fields

- Journal Entry : Journal Entry
- Account : Chart of Account
- Debit Amount : Number
- Credit Amount : Number
- Line Memo : Rich Text

Permissions

Accountant

- View

Supervisor

- View

Views

- Ledger List : List
- Trial Balance : Report
- Line Detail : Detail
